The AMBER force-field parameters embedded in the files under test/fixtures/ are
not covered by this licence. They were produced by AmberTools' tleap from the
ff14SB and TIP3P parameter sets and remain under their own terms; see
https://ambermd.org/. They are included only as small test systems, and
tools/oracle/make_fixtures.sh regenerates all of them from a local AmberTools.
